The year 2017 has <imath>365</imath> days, or <imath>6</imath> cycles and <imath>5</imath> days.

* For each cycle, there are <imath>24</imath> days that Mrs. Sanders does not receive a phone call, as indicated by the white squares.

* For the last <imath>5</imath> days, there are <imath>2</imath> days that Mrs. Sanders does not receive a phone call, as indicated by the first <imath>5</imath> days in a cycle.

Together, the answer is <imath>24\cdot6+2=\boxed{\textbf{(D) }146}.</imath>

